<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25733" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lampsăcum</span></b> , i,
		n., and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lampsă-cus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-os</span></b> ), i, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λάμψακος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a city of Mysia, on the Hellespont</i>,
			now <i>Lamsaki</i>. —Form Lampsacum, <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 1, 24, § 63</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Mel. 1,
				19</span></i>.—Form Lampsacus, <i><span class="en">Val. Fl. 2,
				624</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. Tr. 1, 10, 26</span></i>.—Hence,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lampsăcēnus</span></b> , a, um, <i>adj., of</i> or <i>belonging to
				Lampsacum, Lampsacene</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">urbs,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Max. 7, 3, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">homines,</span>”
				i. e. <i>inhabitants of Lampsacum, Lampsacenes</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 1, 24, § 63</span></i>
			.—<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lampsăcēni</span></b> ,
				ōrum, m., <i>the inhabitants of Lampsacum, the Lampsacenes</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 1, 32, §
			81</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lampsăcĭus</span></b> , a, um, <i>adj., of</i> or <i>belonging to
				Lampsacum</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">versus,</span>”
				i. e. <i>obscene</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. 11, 16, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">puellae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					11, 51, 2</span></i>
			.</div>
